{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO THE COMPANY, CREW MEMBER... READY TO PURGE SOME ANOMALIES?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Anomaly Company you and your crew are sent in to assess reality in this <strong>4-player co-op horror game</strong>. Set in realistic, liminal environments, you must memorize your surroundings and spot <strong>disturbing anomalies</strong>. Decide if the timeline is safe. One bad call\u2014and you\u2019re forced to start over.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARE YOU PREPARED TO CONTAIN THE ANOMALOUS TIMELINES?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099190/extras/0a323e6d16b2e0efcd3db6048d5d8bdb.poster.avif?t=1772324393\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099190/extras/0a323e6d16b2e0efcd3db6048d5d8bdb.webm?t=1772324393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099190/extras/0a323e6d16b2e0efcd3db6048d5d8bdb.mp4?t=1772324393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1\u20134 Player Online Co-Op</strong> <br>Play solo or with up to <strong>4 players online</strong> in a cooperative horror experience. Communicate using <strong>voice chat or text chat</strong> to analyze environments, share observations, and argue over whether an anomaly is present.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Your Job as a Crew member</strong>  <br>Each level begins in a stable state. Memorize the environment, then watch closely as <strong>subtle changes, disturbing anomalies, and terrifying events</strong> may occur. Decide whether the timeline is safe or must be purged to progress.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A SOLO DEV PROJECT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m a <strong>solo developer</strong> working on Anomaly Company entirely by myself. Every feature, update, and fix is made by me. Because of this, development can be slower than that of a typical game studio\u2014but it also means the game is built with <strong>care, passion, and close attention to player feedback</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099190/extras/2887b888dd09284118391f6281e7a0ad.avif?t=1772324393\" width=1560 height=176 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THINGS YOU CAN DO IN ANOMALY COMPANY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1\u20134 Player Online Co-Op</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-Op Horror Gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Replayability</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Chat &amp; Text Chat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic &amp; Liminal Environments</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disturbing Anomalies &amp; Jumpscares</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observation-Based Gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique maps</strong>, each with a unique setting and loads of anomalies</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENTER A WORLD THAT FEELS UNCOMFORTABLY REAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099190/extras/527b31990f77b529b71fd17384de869f.poster.avif?t=1772324393\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099190/extras/527b31990f77b529b71fd17384de869f.webm?t=1772324393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://sh